{"id":"d78fcb91853d210c","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-lem-bad.md","title":"Bad Function Range Bound","display":"lem-bad — Bad Function Range Bound","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-bad","aliases":["58-lem-bad"],"display":"lem-bad — Bad Function Range Bound","depends_on":["[[58-df-bad]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-regular]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-bad"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-bad</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-bad — Bad Function Range Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"af66d7a1a23425d7\" href=\"?note=af66d7a1a23425d7\" title=\"58-df-bad\">58-df-bad</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"58-df-regular\">58-df-regular</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(f,\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\)</span> is the regular-cardinal alias and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bad}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bad}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> is the exact upstream bad-function predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bad}\\vdash \\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Bad}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\to\\kappa\\leq\\lambda.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bad}\\vdash \\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Bad}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\to\\kappa\\leq\\lambda.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\)</span>, regularity makes the union of the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> many fibers have size below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, contradicting that their union is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This file retains its legacy label while stating the consequence actually supported by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"af66d7a1a23425d7\" href=\"?note=af66d7a1a23425d7\" title=\"58-df-bad\">58-df-bad</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-bad","status":"resolved","id":"af66d7a1a23425d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bad]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bad","status":"resolved","id":"af66d7a1a23425d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This file retains its legacy label while stating the consequence actually supported by [[58-df-bad]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bad}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bad}\\vdash \\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Bad}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\to\\kappa\\leq\\lambda.","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda<\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":863,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3874","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-lem-bad.md|58-lem-bad]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["af66d7a1a23425d7","5fb1c2241d1943d1","d83de8696e4dad26"]}